  "question": {
    "text": "Two second after projection a projectile is travelling in a direction inclined at <math><msup><mrow><mn>30</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></math> with horizontal, after one more second it is travelling horizontally. Angle of projection (in degree) with horizontal divided by 10 is."
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "6",
  "solution": {
    "text": "Let angle made by <math><mover><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>→</mo></mrow></mover></math> initially and after time t be <math><mi>θ</mi></math> and <math><mi>α</mi></math> respectively.<br /><math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>30</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>u</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>g</mi><mo>×</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>u</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></math>…….…(i)<br /><math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>u</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>g</mi><mo>×</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>u</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></math> …….…(ii)<br /><math><mo>∴</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>60</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></math>"
  }
